@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@policyId = POL-1001

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Apply endorsement
POST {{baseUrl}}/policies/{{policyId}}/endorsements
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: END-2001

{
  "effective_date": "2026-07-01",
  "new_annual_premium_cents": 144000,
  "reason": "Water-shutoff discount removed"
}

### Replay exact endorsement
POST {{baseUrl}}/policies/{{policyId}}/endorsements
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: END-2001

{
  "effective_date": "2026-07-01",
  "new_annual_premium_cents": 144000,
  "reason": "Water-shutoff discount removed"
}

### Conflict: same key, different payload
POST {{baseUrl}}/policies/{{policyId}}/endorsements
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: END-2001

{
  "effective_date": "2026-07-01",
  "new_annual_premium_cents": 145000,
  "reason": "Conflicting retry"
}

### Record received payment data
POST {{baseUrl}}/policies/{{policyId}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: PAY-9001

{
  "external_payment_id": "PAY-9001",
  "amount_cents": 12099,
  "currency": "USD",
  "received_at": "2026-07-03T18:30:00Z"
}

### Replay exact payment delivery
POST {{baseUrl}}/policies/{{policyId}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: PAY-9001

{
  "external_payment_id": "PAY-9001",
  "amount_cents": 12099,
  "currency": "USD",
  "received_at": "2026-07-03T18:30:00Z"
}

### Reject wrong currency atomically
POST {{baseUrl}}/policies/{{policyId}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: PAY-9002

{
  "external_payment_id": "PAY-9002",
  "amount_cents": 5000,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "received_at": "2026-07-04T10:00:00Z"
}

### Policy state
GET {{baseUrl}}/policies/{{policyId}}

### Ledger proof
GET {{baseUrl}}/policies/{{policyId}}/ledger

### Verify policy history
GET {{baseUrl}}/policies/{{policyId}}/history/verify
